---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { digitalServices } from '../../data/services';
---
<BaseLayout title="Digital Services | Websites, Software & Marketing | Overdott" description="Explore website development, custom software, business applications and digital marketing enquiries from Overdott Technologies in Kenya.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-width page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">Digital services</p><h1>Digital tools and experiences, built around real work.</h1><p>Explore websites, software and online visibility services that complement your broader technology environment.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section page-width"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">From online presence to business workflows</p><h2>Digital services with a practical foundation.</h2><p>Every service is available to enquire about. A requirements conversation establishes deliverables, scope and delivery approach.</p></div><div class="card-grid">{digitalServices.map((service,index)=><article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">0{index+1} / DIGITAL</span><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.summary}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/services/${service.slug}/`}>Explore this service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-tint"><div class="page-width image-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Part of the bigger picture</p><h2>Connect your digital presence to the systems behind it.</h2><p>A website, workflow or marketing initiative can depend on hosting, security, data and ongoing technical support. We can discuss those needs together and make dependencies clear.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Clear project objectives and requirements</li><li>Consideration of existing tools and integrations</li><li>Accessibility and mobile usability in the plan</li><li>Handover and maintenance options where agreed</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/solutions/">Explore technology solutions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Business analytics and digital services displayed on a screen" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" /></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="page-width cta-inner"><div><h2>Have a digital project in mind?</h2><p>Tell us what you want people or your team to be able to do.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>